T188 - real GPU rain-support field, two campaigns
Branch experiment/cloud-descriptor-k, parent 6f315fa (T187). Not merged.
Ultra, raw scale 0.2500, cloud target 480x270, framebuffer 1920x1080,
96 steps, 60 samples per cell, three anchor-bracketed blocks per arm per pose.

Run C is the timing run. Run D repeats it with the field forced onto the
diagnostic monolith so the ray-side fetch count and the post-field
attribution can be read - the monolith is the only program whose DebugView
is live, and without the force those counters read zero.

An earlier launch (t188 first attempt) crashed the volumetric pass with
ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException: Index 12 out of bounds for length 12 from a
thirteenth JSON sampler, and is not reported here except as the defect.

